<title>UK: Citibank sets call, put warrants on currency pairs.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets call, put warrants on currency pairs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank NA has issued 340 million call and put warrants, in 17 equal tranches, on five different currency pairs, lead manager Citibank SA said.</p>
<p>There are six tranches on the U.S. dollar/French franc, three call and three put, three tranches on the mark/French franc, two call and one put and two tranches on the U.S. dollar/mark rate of which there is one call and one put tranche.</p>
<p>There is also two call and two put tranches on the U.S. dollar/Japanese yen and one tranche of call warrants and one tranche of put warrants on the Japanese yen/French franc.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 17.SEP.96-23.OCT.97   VALUE DATE   16.SEP.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS		     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
